    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;The proposed single storey rear extension, by virtue of depth and siting would create adverse impact to neighbouring amenity at no. 68 Albury Drive, in terms of appearing overbearing and creating a loss of light and outlook, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of The London Plan (2021) and Policy GR1 of The Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;In the absence of a Reasonable Exception Statement, it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would satisfactorily address fire safety, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D12 A of the London Plan (2021) and Policy GR3B of The Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
